taglib: TagLib is a library for reading and editing the metadata of several
taglib: popular audio formats. Currently, it supports various metadata
taglib: containers such as ID3v1, ID3v2, and Vorbis comments for MP3, MP4,
taglib: AAC, Ogg, Opus, FLAC, Speex, APE, MPC, WavPack, WAV, AIFF, 
taglib: TrueAudio, Matroska, WebM, ASF, WMA, DSF, DFF, and tracker (MOD, XM,
taglib: S3M, IT) files.
